\tag{fdip}
\title{Walls, transfer and refinement}
\date{2026-11-27}

\p{A constant mass shift selects the free Wilson corners that enter the [bulk integer](fdip-019W). If the mass takes two values on a periodic lattice, the regions meet along two interfaces. How much of the Hermitian operator on the whole field space can be recovered from either region or from the links where they meet?}
\transclude{fdip-01B1}
